Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 12:55:02 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] [Perf] Add adaptive DP prefill alignment

Coordinate deferred prefills across data-parallel engine ranks with a nonblocking observation, release, and acknowledgment protocol. Keep the disabled path unchanged and bound coordinator stalls with pass and wall-clock fail-open behavior.

Co-authored-by: OpenAI Codex <codex@openai.com>
Signed-off-by: Kaihang Jiang <kaihangj@nvidia.com>
